# --- ADMIN / SECRETS -----------------------------------------------
# These run the live dashboard and contain the admin password hash.
# They are deliberately NOT published. They are uploaded straight to
# the web host via DirectAdmin, never through this repo.
# (They would not work on GitHub Pages anyway — it cannot run PHP.)
admin-api.php
dashboard.php
dashboard.html
.admin-backups/

# dashboard-demo.html IS published on purpose: it is the read-only preview
# version of the control panel (no password, no server code, edits kept in the
# viewer's browser only) so reviewers can see the dashboard on the preview link.
!dashboard-demo.html

